      "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "F1 differs slightly: 1 QN → 2 Geo ID + BREAKOFF → 3 ICF → 4 content.  Its ICF already sits directly after the form carrying BREAKOFF.",
